WEBVTT

00:16.266 --> 00:18.601
Why am I here on my first day off in ages?

00:18.685 --> 00:20.937
Your one and only girlfriend
is going to work.

00:21.021 --> 00:22.439
You must escort her.

00:22.522 --> 00:25.692
And I need to pick up my only girlfriend
after school, right?

00:25.775 --> 00:27.610
Of course!

00:27.694 --> 00:30.280
You said you'd protect me.
Aren't you going to?

00:30.780 --> 00:33.366
Of course I will.
That's what I'm doing right now.

00:33.450 --> 00:35.785
But I've been protecting you too much, so…

00:35.869 --> 00:38.079
-Should we go to your grandma's?
-No, we can't.

00:38.163 --> 00:40.790
-Then let's drink at your place.
-Seriously, those punks…

00:40.874 --> 00:42.792
-Fuck you, you dumbass.
-No, don't.

00:42.876 --> 00:45.045
Just stay put.
Kids today are really scary.

00:45.545 --> 00:46.463
No, we can't.

00:46.546 --> 00:48.298
So just let them be?

00:48.381 --> 00:50.967
If adults fear children,
the world is doomed.

00:51.051 --> 00:52.302
Besides, I'm a teacher.

00:52.385 --> 00:54.137
-We'll beat up your brother.
-Let's go.

00:54.220 --> 00:56.514
Beat up my brother?
I dare you, you fucker.

00:56.598 --> 00:57.515
-Try.
-Where is he?

00:57.599 --> 00:59.976
He's at home gaming. Go beat him up.

01:00.060 --> 01:01.227
By the way,

01:02.854 --> 01:04.022
you'll protect me, right?

01:06.941 --> 01:08.526
Yes, ma'am. I'll protect you.

01:09.444 --> 01:10.695
Go give them hell.

01:11.362 --> 01:12.989
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, ma'am.

01:16.785 --> 01:17.619
Hey, guys!

01:18.119 --> 01:19.954
Hey, guys. Put out your cigarettes.

01:20.705 --> 01:22.540
-Your school and names?
-Who are you?

01:24.876 --> 01:27.504
Ms. Choi Ga-yun was a courageous teacher.

01:28.004 --> 01:29.631
She even accepted the accused,

01:29.714 --> 01:32.050
Cho Gyu-cheol,
who was more than a troublemaker.

01:32.133 --> 01:36.429
He was a tyrant who repeatedly
extorted and assaulted his classmates.

01:36.930 --> 01:40.683
However, Cho Gyu-cheol,
feared by both classmates and teachers,

01:41.976 --> 01:43.103
committed a heinous act,

01:44.270 --> 01:47.315
one that should never have been done
to a teacher like her.

01:58.451 --> 01:59.410
Defendant,

01:59.953 --> 02:02.080
do you have any final comments?

02:04.124 --> 02:05.041
I was…

02:12.841 --> 02:15.426
in love with Ms. Choi.

02:24.102 --> 02:25.270
Taking into account

02:26.020 --> 02:31.484
that the accused is a minor
and has a troubled family background,

02:32.277 --> 02:35.697
the court sentences him
to two to four years' imprisonment.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.457
I won't take long.

03:41.512 --> 03:43.223
That won't bring Ga-yun back.

03:44.224 --> 03:45.475
It's not your fault.

03:45.975 --> 03:48.061
So have no regrets.

03:50.104 --> 03:51.356
And feel no remorse.

03:53.024 --> 03:56.027
Find the right way, not the easy way.

03:56.903 --> 04:00.698
A way that won't shame Ga-yun,
who said that if adults fear children…

04:02.700 --> 04:03.952
the world is doomed.

04:05.620 --> 04:06.746
Find that kind of way.

04:11.584 --> 04:14.045
I will soon become
the Minister of Education.

04:17.215 --> 04:19.342
And I will create the ERPB.

04:21.594 --> 04:22.512
This…

04:24.597 --> 04:27.058
is the way I've chosen to honor Ga-yun.

04:43.866 --> 04:44.867
Come and find me

04:45.910 --> 04:47.787
if you can't take it anymore.

05:08.641 --> 05:12.854
TEACH YOU A LESSON

05:12.937 --> 05:16.441
EDUCATIONAL RIGHTS PROTECTION BUREAU

05:16.524 --> 05:17.650
-Hello.
-Hello.

05:17.734 --> 05:18.568
Hello.

05:20.862 --> 05:21.696
Hello.

05:21.779 --> 05:22.739
Hello.

05:32.248 --> 05:33.082
Here you are.

05:33.166 --> 05:34.417
Can I get water too?

05:42.383 --> 05:43.217
Next school?

05:43.801 --> 05:44.761
Oh, right.

05:45.511 --> 05:48.848
It's a case where a teacher
sexually harassed a female student.

05:48.931 --> 05:51.267
After the incident, the teacher resigned

05:51.351 --> 05:53.353
and took his own life soon after.

05:53.436 --> 05:55.480
Then isn't it a closed case?

05:55.563 --> 05:57.982
Yes, but they only had
the female student's word.

05:58.066 --> 06:00.860
The case was closed
by the court of public opinion

06:00.943 --> 06:02.070
without due process.

06:02.153 --> 06:03.529
Court of public opinion?

06:04.072 --> 06:05.740
-Did you prepare it?
-Yes, sir.

06:05.823 --> 06:08.659
The incident spread through social media.

06:08.743 --> 06:11.871
After influencers started
tagging the video,

06:11.954 --> 06:14.415
it went completely viral.

06:14.499 --> 06:18.836
A single social-media tag
can sway public opinion these days,

06:18.920 --> 06:21.214
just like comments on online articles.

06:21.297 --> 06:23.925
So the teacher was targeted,
and nothing he said mattered.

06:24.008 --> 06:24.926
I know that much.

06:25.009 --> 06:26.094
That's right, sir.

06:26.177 --> 06:28.096
He was targeted. Got it.

06:28.179 --> 06:30.348
Spin-off videos were also created,

06:30.431 --> 06:32.892
which led to many complaints
to the school.

06:32.975 --> 06:38.689
What teachers also fear most these days
is the impact of social media.

06:38.773 --> 06:40.191
So that's the case here too?

06:40.274 --> 06:42.443
Yes, it began
with Han Ye-ri's social media.

06:43.194 --> 06:44.487
Please take a look.

06:44.570 --> 06:47.156
She has a whopping 600,000 followers.

06:48.449 --> 06:52.412
This means her social media
is being watched by up to 600,000 people.

06:56.624 --> 06:58.126
Hi, everyone. It's Ye-ri.

06:59.460 --> 07:00.962
Ta-da!

07:01.045 --> 07:03.714
Isn't my school just so gorgeous?

07:04.674 --> 07:07.969
It looks even prettier
on nice days like today,

07:08.052 --> 07:10.430
and that puts me in such a good mood.

07:10.513 --> 07:11.764
Don't you feel the same?

07:13.141 --> 07:14.016
Ye-ri is so pretty!

07:16.436 --> 07:17.603
This is my BFF, So-yeong.

07:17.687 --> 07:18.980
Hello.

07:19.063 --> 07:21.524
Of course, So-yeong is on Snstar too.

07:21.607 --> 07:24.318
My handle is "sssoozero."

07:24.402 --> 07:26.779
Just look up "Sso-yeong."
Please follow me!

07:28.197 --> 07:30.491
Right? Isn't So-yeong super pretty?

07:30.575 --> 07:34.120
Hey, isn't this The One from Next Boys?

07:34.203 --> 07:35.371
He sent a follow request.

07:35.455 --> 07:37.123
-That's epic.
-Look at this.

07:37.206 --> 07:40.460
The One, if you're watching this,
please leave a comment.

07:40.543 --> 07:41.836
Han Ye-ri!

07:42.753 --> 07:44.672
Class has already started, okay?

07:44.755 --> 07:47.133
What did I say
about using phones in class?

07:47.216 --> 07:48.426
IS THIS A LIVE BLOOPER?

07:48.509 --> 07:52.054
Oh dear, our Ye-ri here needs to study.
Let's all study.

07:53.473 --> 07:55.141
All right. I'm confiscating this.

07:55.641 --> 07:56.726
But Ms. Jung.

07:56.809 --> 08:00.563
Ye-ri was live streaming.
She'll get called out if you do that.

08:00.646 --> 08:03.399
Remember that this is my class. Okay?

08:03.483 --> 08:05.776
Put that English book away.

08:05.860 --> 08:07.945
-All right, math books out.
-Are you okay?

08:08.029 --> 08:11.073
-What page were we on?
-We were on page 12.

08:14.785 --> 08:16.120
-Ms. Jung?
-Yes.

08:16.204 --> 08:18.831
Have you seen Han Ye-ri's Snstar
by any chance?

08:18.915 --> 08:21.417
Ye-ri's Snstar? No. Why do you ask?

08:23.127 --> 08:24.128
Huh?

08:24.212 --> 08:26.047
Why does this look so weird?

08:26.130 --> 08:29.175
I was helping So-yeong
cut the gum out of her hair

08:29.258 --> 08:30.885
because she asked me to.

08:30.968 --> 08:33.262
I think it was edited to look that way.

08:33.346 --> 08:36.098
Didn't you hear about Ms. Hwang last year?

08:37.141 --> 08:39.310
She was out drinking
with her college friends,

08:39.393 --> 08:41.229
and they made a flirty video of it.

08:41.312 --> 08:44.440
Her info was leaked, so she took leave.
It was a huge mess.

08:44.524 --> 08:47.151
It was likely payback
for confiscating Han Ye-ri's phone.

08:47.235 --> 08:48.402
About that…

08:49.862 --> 08:51.572
I'll speak to Ye-ri about it.

08:52.073 --> 08:54.158
It might be best,
as I'm her homeroom teacher.

08:54.242 --> 08:56.202
All right. Thank you.

08:56.744 --> 08:57.620
COUNSELING OFFICE

08:57.703 --> 09:00.498
Ms. Jung says it's a misunderstanding.

09:00.998 --> 09:03.543
I just recorded it and uploaded it as is.

09:03.626 --> 09:05.962
Let's upload it again,
with the original audio.

09:06.045 --> 09:07.588
That should clear things up.

09:07.672 --> 09:11.384
Do you think
I intentionally removed the audio?

09:13.094 --> 09:14.262
It's just that

09:14.804 --> 09:16.514
I happened to see something.

09:17.765 --> 09:19.058
Remove the audio,

09:19.559 --> 09:22.728
trim the beginning and end,

09:23.771 --> 09:25.398
and add sad background music.

09:25.898 --> 09:27.358
Doesn't it look so different?

09:27.441 --> 09:29.026
Yeah, for sure.

09:31.070 --> 09:33.239
She was so annoying, so this is great.

09:35.366 --> 09:38.202
I'm not sure
why you think so badly of teachers.

09:38.286 --> 09:40.246
You weren't always like this.

09:41.414 --> 09:43.165
I've seen your middle school records.

09:43.249 --> 09:46.794
You got good grades
and got on well with your teachers.

09:54.468 --> 09:55.761
I'll think about it.

10:18.326 --> 10:20.244
My homeroom teacher

10:21.412 --> 10:23.372
sexually harassed me.

10:27.001 --> 10:28.586
I DEBATED WHETHER TO POST THIS

10:28.669 --> 10:30.463
What do I do?

10:32.673 --> 10:33.841
What do I do?

10:34.508 --> 10:35.593
THAT SOB
I'LL STOP BY

10:35.676 --> 10:36.677
TRASH TEACHER
DOX HIM

10:36.761 --> 10:38.262
GET THAT BASTARD AN ANKLE TAG

10:38.346 --> 10:39.513
JUST DIE, FUCKING BASTARD

10:39.597 --> 10:40.765
MOTHERFUCKER! FIRE HIM!

10:40.848 --> 10:41.682
What…

10:42.266 --> 10:43.392
JUST DIE

10:44.101 --> 10:44.935
AND YOU'RE HUMAN?

10:47.855 --> 10:49.607
This is Soyeon Girls' High School.

10:50.191 --> 10:51.317
Yes, well…

10:51.400 --> 10:52.652
Oh, yes. Hello, ma'am.

10:52.735 --> 10:53.903
I get your concern…

10:54.612 --> 10:56.530
-Pardon?
-I'm aware.

10:57.114 --> 10:58.699
I think there's a misunderstanding.

10:58.783 --> 10:59.659
I'll check and…

10:59.742 --> 11:02.286
Excuse me. Are you
Han Ye-ri's homeroom teacher?

11:02.370 --> 11:04.163
Yes, and who might you be?

11:04.246 --> 11:07.750
Guys, this man
is Han Ye-ri's homeroom teacher.

11:07.833 --> 11:10.044
Is it true
that you sexually harassed Han Ye-ri?

11:10.127 --> 11:11.754
Is it? Please don't touch me.

11:11.837 --> 11:14.256
Does your heart race
when you see a school uniform?

11:14.340 --> 11:15.257
Answer me!

11:15.341 --> 11:16.342
We'll call the police.

11:16.425 --> 11:18.344
Go on, call them. Get out of the way!

11:18.427 --> 11:20.054
You can't come in here!

11:20.137 --> 11:21.931
WIFE

11:27.520 --> 11:29.438
What is all this about?

11:29.939 --> 11:32.024
Is it true? It's not, is it?

11:32.108 --> 11:34.110
Answer the phone, honey.

11:42.535 --> 11:43.452
HERE'S HIS ADDRESS

11:43.536 --> 11:45.496
Honey, where are you?

11:45.579 --> 11:48.040
Strangers keep coming to our house.

11:48.124 --> 11:50.251
We're really scared.

11:50.334 --> 11:52.169
HIS KIDS SHOULD SUFFER THE SAME FATE

11:52.253 --> 11:53.629
I BET HE ACTS LOVING AT HOME

11:53.713 --> 11:54.964
LET'S STORM HIS PLACE NOW

11:55.047 --> 11:57.299
I'VE FOUND OUT
WHERE HIS DAMN KIDS GO TO SCHOOL

12:15.693 --> 12:19.530
PUT AN ANKLE TAG ON HIM

12:19.613 --> 12:21.282
GO TO HELL

12:21.365 --> 12:22.742
FUCK YOU

12:28.414 --> 12:29.540
Open the door!

12:30.499 --> 12:31.834
Oh my God.

12:31.917 --> 12:32.752
Mr. Ko!

12:32.835 --> 12:34.378
Oh my God.

12:35.254 --> 12:36.172
Mr. Ko!

12:51.145 --> 12:53.898
DYING WON'T SOLVE ANYTHING
GO TO HELL, YEONG-SU

12:53.981 --> 12:55.775
DEPRAVED TEACHER
SCHOOLS ARE SCARY

13:13.793 --> 13:14.877
Han Ye-ri.

13:16.170 --> 13:17.213
You…

13:18.005 --> 13:19.590
You need to post a new video now.

13:20.299 --> 13:21.717
You can't do this.

13:21.801 --> 13:24.303
Mr. Ko would never do anything like that.

13:26.347 --> 13:28.224
Are you saying I'm someone who would?

13:29.892 --> 13:32.353
Someone who lies
about being sexually harassed

13:33.145 --> 13:34.939
just to torment their teacher?

13:39.068 --> 13:40.736
Mr. Ko…

13:43.906 --> 13:45.366
touched me

13:46.992 --> 13:49.036
and put his hand down my…

13:50.746 --> 13:51.580
Are you saying

13:52.790 --> 13:55.960
I should pretend none of this happened?

13:57.002 --> 13:57.837
Sure.

13:58.838 --> 14:00.172
I'll do that.

14:04.134 --> 14:05.219
Everyone,

14:06.178 --> 14:07.513
I'm sorry.

14:08.389 --> 14:09.640
I don't think

14:10.432 --> 14:13.269
I can continue streaming today.

14:17.064 --> 14:18.566
I don't think I can continue…

14:18.649 --> 14:21.277
What happened with Mr. Ko

14:21.360 --> 14:24.613
has already put the school
in a very difficult position.

14:25.447 --> 14:28.993
Is there any way you could take care
of the issue with Ms. Jung?

14:30.995 --> 14:33.038
If you help us out a little,

14:33.122 --> 14:36.584
the school will accommodate you
and support you as much as possible.

14:39.211 --> 14:42.506
I'm not sure if it's possible,
but I'll try to take care of it.

14:43.007 --> 14:44.341
In return,

14:45.175 --> 14:48.012
could I ask for a favor?

15:03.986 --> 15:07.948
I will be your homeroom teacher
in place of Mr. Ko.

15:08.449 --> 15:09.909
My name is Jung Seon-yeong.

15:16.081 --> 15:17.499
I'll take attendance.

15:19.752 --> 15:21.754
-Kang Da-yeon.
-Here.

15:21.837 --> 15:23.756
-Kang Min-seo.
-Here.

15:23.839 --> 15:25.257
Kwon Na-yeong.

15:25.758 --> 15:27.217
-Kim Da-jeong.
-This is crazy.

15:27.301 --> 15:29.261
Did she become our teacher to pick on you?

15:29.345 --> 15:31.805
-Scary.
-Wasn't she friends with Ko?

15:31.889 --> 15:33.015
No way. Is she crazy?

15:33.098 --> 15:36.352
-Is that why she took this job?
-Our class is screwed.

15:36.435 --> 15:39.104
She said she didn't want the job.
It was all an act.

15:39.188 --> 15:41.273
This is insane. Can't we change classes?

15:41.357 --> 15:43.984
-Why is it Ms. Jung of all people?
-Poor Ye-ri.

15:45.069 --> 15:46.362
Park Seo-yeong.

15:47.112 --> 15:48.155
Park Su-jin.

15:48.656 --> 15:49.490
Here.

15:50.324 --> 15:51.700
Park Ji-hye.

15:52.826 --> 15:54.244
Park Chae-won.

15:56.789 --> 15:58.624
Thanks to you,

15:58.707 --> 16:00.960
I've hit 500,000 followers.

16:01.502 --> 16:02.753
Thank you so much.

16:18.352 --> 16:23.482
As you can see,
she seems to be a very popular influencer.

16:23.565 --> 16:26.610
Don't you think this might cause trouble
if we get involved?

16:27.194 --> 16:28.320
That's more work for us.

16:28.404 --> 16:29.655
Don't worry about that.

16:29.738 --> 16:32.533
Minister Choi has agreed
to take full responsibility.

16:32.616 --> 16:33.575
I see.

16:33.659 --> 16:36.328
600,000 followers.

16:36.829 --> 16:37.830
You punk…

16:40.582 --> 16:42.751
Do it! Of course we should do it!

16:43.252 --> 16:45.754
Whether 600,000 or six million,
we must do what we must.

16:46.380 --> 16:47.506
That's right! Do it!

16:47.589 --> 16:48.924
Deputy Bong, get ready too.

16:49.008 --> 16:51.176
What's my role this time around?

16:51.260 --> 16:54.346
Why do you even ask?
Obviously, you'll go undercover as a girl.

16:54.930 --> 16:57.182
What? Are you serious?

17:06.400 --> 17:08.527
Why are you taking it so seriously?

17:10.070 --> 17:11.864
Am I really dressing up as a girl?

17:11.947 --> 17:13.449
If so, would you?

17:14.241 --> 17:15.617
Why even consider it?

17:17.244 --> 17:18.829
Deputy Bong, provide backup.

17:19.747 --> 17:21.749
Inspector Na, get out into the field now.

17:21.832 --> 17:23.292
It won't be me this time.

17:23.375 --> 17:25.669
Who else, then?
You're the only inspector we have.

17:25.753 --> 17:27.212
I've hired a new one.

17:29.173 --> 17:33.844
She's perfect for this case,
so why don't you just see how she does?

17:40.726 --> 17:44.063
Ta-da! I drew Ye-ri. What do you think?
Looks like her, doesn't it?

17:44.146 --> 17:48.692
By the way, everyone,
So-yeong keeps insisting I'm like a cat.

17:48.776 --> 17:53.322
This is Ms. Im Han-rim,
our student teacher here for training.

17:55.240 --> 17:57.159
-Please introduce yourself.
-Okay.

17:58.160 --> 17:59.411
Hello.

17:59.495 --> 18:02.915
My name is Im Han-rim, and I teach math.

18:02.998 --> 18:05.584
Depending on how you all behave,

18:05.667 --> 18:07.544
I can become an angel,

18:07.628 --> 18:09.671
or I can become a devil.

18:09.755 --> 18:11.173
I hope we get along well.

18:14.384 --> 18:16.136
I'll take attendance.

18:16.887 --> 18:17.888
Kang Da-yeon.

18:18.388 --> 18:20.057
Kim Ye-rin.

18:20.641 --> 18:23.393
I don't think the front teeth
look the same.

18:23.477 --> 18:25.687
-No, they do.
-Don't they look the same?

18:25.771 --> 18:29.316
Guys, they're selecting uniform models
from Soyeon Girls' High this time.

18:29.399 --> 18:31.151
Our uniform is particularly pretty.

18:34.196 --> 18:36.323
No, I'm completely asymmetrical.

18:36.406 --> 18:38.617
I just always film my left side,

18:38.700 --> 18:40.661
but if I move the camera to my right…

18:49.795 --> 18:50.629
Miss.

18:51.338 --> 18:52.172
Yes?

18:52.881 --> 18:53.882
Ms. Im.

18:54.508 --> 18:56.135
Yes, what is it?

18:56.218 --> 18:57.469
Do you have a boyfriend?

19:01.390 --> 19:02.266
I do not.

19:02.349 --> 19:04.434
Why not? You're so pretty.

19:05.018 --> 19:06.019
Your cosmetic surgery…

19:06.770 --> 19:08.230
-It was done really well.
-Hey.

19:08.814 --> 19:11.024
You probably spent
well over ten million won.

19:11.108 --> 19:13.652
Can we see a before photo
to see how well it turned out?

19:13.735 --> 19:16.029
Guys, aren't you curious? Aren't you?

19:16.113 --> 19:19.032
Show us!

19:19.116 --> 19:22.828
Show us!

19:22.911 --> 19:25.497
Show us!

19:34.548 --> 19:35.674
Yes.

19:35.757 --> 19:37.676
I've had cosmetic surgery.

19:38.802 --> 19:40.012
Breast reduction surgery.

19:41.054 --> 19:43.849
I like playing sports,
and they got in the way.

19:44.725 --> 19:46.602
So I got them done.

19:46.685 --> 19:49.021
But it seems

19:49.104 --> 19:53.984
no one in this class needs any reduction,

19:54.067 --> 19:56.570
so I won't take any further questions.

19:57.487 --> 19:59.323
Is she crazy? Who does she think she is?

19:59.406 --> 20:02.284
-So-yeong is so cheeky.
-Let's get back to the lesson.

20:02.367 --> 20:03.785
Before we do that,

20:03.869 --> 20:06.914
I think we need to collect
everyone's phones first.

20:08.290 --> 20:11.126
Everyone, hand in your phones!

20:11.710 --> 20:12.753
She must be crazy.

20:12.836 --> 20:14.004
What does that mean?

20:14.588 --> 20:15.756
Is that a buzzword?

20:16.256 --> 20:18.926
You know I'm not up-to-date
with buzzwords.

20:19.009 --> 20:20.219
Even Reels…

20:22.054 --> 20:23.180
Han Ye-ri.

20:23.680 --> 20:25.599
Hand in your phone.

20:27.809 --> 20:30.187
I'm in the middle of a live stream.

20:30.854 --> 20:35.108
You're new, so you probably haven't heard,
but the principal gave me permission.

20:38.654 --> 20:40.239
This is the last time.

20:40.864 --> 20:44.201
Hand in your phone.

20:46.328 --> 20:52.251
Then do you want to tell my fans yourself?

20:57.881 --> 20:59.925
IS THIS A LIVE BLOOPER?
COME BACK YE-RI

21:07.933 --> 21:09.101
END THE LIVE STREAM?

21:09.184 --> 21:10.060
That scared me.

21:10.143 --> 21:12.104
Are you crazy? What are you doing?

21:12.187 --> 21:13.981
It's the students who are crazy.

21:14.773 --> 21:18.151
The school is much more messed up
than I expected.

21:18.235 --> 21:21.029
Those who act like they're above teachers,

21:21.113 --> 21:23.740
those who treat teachers like toys,

21:25.033 --> 21:27.369
and those who make fools of their teachers

21:28.120 --> 21:31.915
will now be considered
to be in violation of teachers' rights.

21:32.666 --> 21:34.501
I will always accept challenges,

21:34.584 --> 21:37.212
but you must be prepared
to face punishment.

21:37.296 --> 21:38.839
Ms. Im.

21:39.464 --> 21:41.008
Aren't you overreacting?

21:41.091 --> 21:43.218
Let me introduce myself again.

21:44.136 --> 21:47.097
I am Im Han-rim,
an inspector from the ERPB

21:47.180 --> 21:50.976
that operates
under Korea's Ministry of Education.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.562
From this moment on,

21:53.645 --> 21:57.524
I will severely punish
all violations of educational rights

21:57.607 --> 21:59.860
occurring here
at Soyeon Girls' High School.

21:59.943 --> 22:02.487
Then I will destroy
the root causes of it all.

22:03.155 --> 22:07.159
The first step to this is the phones!

22:07.743 --> 22:11.663
Hand over your phones right this second!

22:34.436 --> 22:39.483
I hope what you've just handed in
isn't a second phone or an inactive phone

22:39.566 --> 22:42.361
to fool teachers.

22:42.444 --> 22:44.821
For any students who have done so,

22:44.905 --> 22:47.741
for the final time, I will count to three.

22:50.660 --> 22:51.787
One!

22:52.954 --> 22:54.164
Two!

22:54.664 --> 22:55.874
Three!

23:03.799 --> 23:05.092
PHONE POSSESSION WARNING

23:19.689 --> 23:20.607
Attention students.

23:20.690 --> 23:24.778
There will now be an announcement
of special directives from the ERPB.

23:27.406 --> 23:28.240
First,

23:29.241 --> 23:33.495
Soyeon Girls' High School
now falls under the authority of the ERPB.

23:36.373 --> 23:37.374
Second,

23:37.457 --> 23:41.837
there are no restrictions whatsoever
on the ERPB's teaching methods.

23:44.339 --> 23:45.298
Third,

23:45.799 --> 23:48.343
you must always follow
the inspector's instructions.

23:50.846 --> 23:51.888
Fourth,

23:52.472 --> 23:54.057
in the event of insubordination,

23:54.141 --> 23:56.977
we will not be responsible
for any disadvantages that arise.

23:57.686 --> 23:59.396
TEACHERS' MAIN OFFICE

24:02.732 --> 24:04.901
I'm here from the ERPB.

24:11.992 --> 24:13.410
-Attention!
-Did someone snitch?

24:14.619 --> 24:16.455
"In the event of insubordination,

24:16.538 --> 24:19.249
we won't be responsible
for any disadvantages that arise."

24:19.833 --> 24:21.126
You heard that, right?

24:21.209 --> 24:24.629
Everyone, report to the field!

24:25.797 --> 24:28.175
Please write the details
on the form given to you.

24:28.258 --> 24:32.429
It could be that you were falsely accused,
which led to defamation.

24:32.512 --> 24:34.389
Or maybe you raised this issue,

24:34.890 --> 24:37.851
only to find yourself
being bullied by the students.

24:38.351 --> 24:42.355
Perhaps you're aware of colleagues
who are suffering online

24:43.231 --> 24:47.694
from leaked personal information,
judged appearances, and edited photos.

24:47.777 --> 24:49.321
But you're too scared of the kids,

24:49.905 --> 24:54.701
or maybe you have no choice
and have turned a blind eye.

24:54.784 --> 24:56.286
Whatever it may be,

24:57.829 --> 24:58.705
please tell us.

25:03.543 --> 25:08.840
May I take your silence as consent
to hand over full control to the ERPB?

25:08.924 --> 25:11.593
Pardon? No, it's not that.

25:11.676 --> 25:14.471
It means our school
doesn't have any problems.

25:15.138 --> 25:17.516
If adults fear children,

25:18.433 --> 25:20.101
the world is doomed.

25:20.977 --> 25:24.731
Don't you think it would be even worse
for teachers?

25:24.814 --> 25:26.900
TEACHERS' RIGHTS VIOLATIONS SURVEY

25:26.983 --> 25:27.859
Well…

25:29.236 --> 25:30.904
Please don't think too hard.

25:31.696 --> 25:32.697
It's simple enough.

25:33.615 --> 25:36.117
If you think of anything later,
please write it down

25:36.201 --> 25:38.161
and give it to Inspector Im Han-rim or me.

25:38.245 --> 25:40.705
No chanting on the final repetition!

25:40.789 --> 25:43.083
-Proceed.
-Proceed.

25:46.670 --> 25:48.547
Please hand in the forms to me.

25:49.047 --> 25:51.174
I think that would be best.

25:53.635 --> 25:54.928
Six.

25:56.888 --> 25:57.973
Seven.

26:00.267 --> 26:01.726
Eight.

26:02.769 --> 26:03.728
Hey!

26:05.647 --> 26:06.773
Lift your damn heads up!

26:09.734 --> 26:10.694
One.

26:10.777 --> 26:12.279
SNACK BAR

26:13.238 --> 26:14.406
Unity!

26:15.949 --> 26:17.242
Look at you.

26:17.826 --> 26:19.703
Hey! Unity!

26:20.662 --> 26:21.538
Reporting, sir!

26:21.621 --> 26:25.250
Sergeant First Class, Im Han-rim,
Special Forces Reserve!

26:25.333 --> 26:27.919
I have been assigned
to ERPB duty as of today!

26:28.003 --> 26:28.878
Unity!

26:28.962 --> 26:31.339
What's with the report between civilians?
At ease.

26:32.173 --> 26:33.466
Even so!

26:34.301 --> 26:35.135
Unity!

26:38.888 --> 26:39.973
Hey.

26:40.056 --> 26:41.224
My goodness.

26:41.308 --> 26:43.810
Hey, your disguise is great, Im Han-rim.

26:43.893 --> 26:45.270
No, don't. It's embarrassing.

26:45.353 --> 26:48.398
You haven't met yet, have you?

26:48.481 --> 26:49.482
Come here.

26:49.566 --> 26:52.444
This is Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae.

26:52.527 --> 26:53.862
It's "Deputy Bong" for short.

26:55.071 --> 26:56.239
Deputy Bong.

26:57.115 --> 26:58.450
He's not just any deputy.

26:58.950 --> 27:02.537
You know KAIST, right?
He graduated from there in just two years.

27:02.621 --> 27:03.913
Wow, is that right?

27:04.956 --> 27:08.001
Nice to meet you.
I served in the same unit as Hwa-jin.

27:09.377 --> 27:10.462
Right…

27:11.379 --> 27:12.589
My name is Bong Geun-dae.

27:14.924 --> 27:16.009
What is it?

27:16.092 --> 27:17.344
What? What is it?

27:18.219 --> 27:20.347
I was sizing him up,
as it's our first meeting.

27:22.057 --> 27:24.934
Just be understanding, Deputy Bong.
She's a bit of a nutcase.

27:30.649 --> 27:32.233
So when will you tell me?

27:32.317 --> 27:33.526
Tell you what?

27:33.610 --> 27:37.489
You said you'd tell me why you hired me
once I started work.

27:37.572 --> 27:39.324
I just did. Because you're a nutcase.

27:39.407 --> 27:41.326
Is that really all?

27:45.622 --> 27:46.623
Here's a question.

27:47.707 --> 27:51.252
Kids are getting more cunning
and doing things that defy common sense.

27:51.336 --> 27:52.170
What should we do?

27:52.253 --> 27:54.297
Beat a nutcase with a nutcase. Am I right?

27:54.381 --> 27:55.215
That's right!

27:55.298 --> 27:57.133
Here, anything crazy goes!

27:57.217 --> 28:00.178
I like that a lot!

28:01.721 --> 28:02.597
However,

28:03.682 --> 28:05.684
remember one thing.

28:07.852 --> 28:10.146
You can't kill anyone. All right?

28:10.230 --> 28:11.815
If you feel the urge,

28:11.898 --> 28:16.653
write the Chinese character for "patience"
on your palm three times.

28:18.154 --> 28:18.988
Understood, sir.

28:20.156 --> 28:22.617
Is this the correct Chinese character
for "patience"?

28:23.368 --> 28:25.036
That's "benevolence."

28:25.620 --> 28:27.414
Maybe you need a little benevolence.

28:27.497 --> 28:30.875
I know. Deputy Bong, you should teach her
how to write "patience."

28:30.959 --> 28:33.169
There's a lot you can learn from him.

28:33.670 --> 28:34.504
Try writing it.

28:37.841 --> 28:38.675
Well…

28:40.009 --> 28:40.844
PATIENCE

28:40.927 --> 28:44.180
"Cut your heart with a knife."

28:44.264 --> 28:47.183
This is how I memorized it for exams.

28:47.267 --> 28:49.436
Cut out the hearts of enemies!

28:51.104 --> 28:52.689
I've learned it. Thank you.

28:57.861 --> 28:58.737
Let's get to work.

28:59.863 --> 29:01.531
I'll do what I always do. Unity!

29:02.282 --> 29:04.200
-No more saluting.
-Understood, sir.

29:04.909 --> 29:06.035
I like your ribbon.

29:06.119 --> 29:07.746
Right. Damn it.

29:11.833 --> 29:12.667
Deputy Bong.

29:15.503 --> 29:17.255
It's Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae.

29:17.338 --> 29:20.800
Do you know the most dangerous place
in a girls' high school?

29:21.926 --> 29:22.969
No.

29:29.976 --> 29:31.186
It's right here.

29:32.353 --> 29:33.855
The snack bar.

29:34.981 --> 29:38.067
What's so dangerous about a snack bar?

29:40.612 --> 29:41.446
Work hard.

30:02.008 --> 30:04.803
Slow down!

30:06.179 --> 30:07.347
Move!

30:09.432 --> 30:10.683
No!

30:12.519 --> 30:15.063
Wait. You can't just open them
and eat them like that.

30:15.563 --> 30:17.106
Guys, you've got to pay!

30:17.190 --> 30:18.900
Pay up!

30:28.284 --> 30:30.370
Where are you all going right now?

30:30.453 --> 30:31.746
Class is finished.

30:31.830 --> 30:33.414
You still have afternoon homeroom.

30:34.290 --> 30:35.500
That's not a thing here.

30:35.583 --> 30:36.709
What about cleaning?

30:43.049 --> 30:45.301
Our teacher told us not to.

30:46.010 --> 30:47.303
She said she'd do it.

30:50.682 --> 30:51.641
Didn't you?

30:52.851 --> 30:54.936
Well, I…

30:58.982 --> 31:01.776
Did you not see the special directives?

31:02.652 --> 31:05.113
If you mess with the inspector,
you're dead.

31:05.738 --> 31:07.073
Damn it.

31:09.033 --> 31:12.245
The people who use the space
are responsible for cleaning it.

31:17.709 --> 31:18.710
All right.

31:19.335 --> 31:21.337
No one is exempt.

31:21.421 --> 31:24.507
Today, we will begin "keeping house."

31:24.591 --> 31:27.468
-What is "keeping house"?
-Desks and chairs to the back.

31:27.969 --> 31:29.012
All the way back.

31:33.516 --> 31:35.518
All the way!

31:42.609 --> 31:46.821
Scrub the floors
until you can see your reflection.

31:54.370 --> 31:55.496
My socks…

31:58.249 --> 32:00.668
Ms. Im, are you sure this will be okay?

32:00.752 --> 32:03.254
The parents may protest…

32:14.641 --> 32:17.810
AFTER THE KO YEONG-SU INCIDENT,
SHE BECAME OUR TEACHER TO TORMENT US

32:17.894 --> 32:19.520
AND NOW SHE HAS CALLED ON THE ERPB

32:19.604 --> 32:21.689
WE'RE ALL BEING FRAMED,
INCLUDING POOR YE-RI

32:30.073 --> 32:32.200
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

32:40.583 --> 32:41.709
Hey!

32:42.210 --> 32:44.671
-Great work, sir!
-Great work today.

32:44.754 --> 32:48.174
I told you no saluting. We're civilians.

32:48.257 --> 32:49.467
Understood, sir.

32:49.550 --> 32:50.969
-Is this what I asked for?
-Yes.

32:51.469 --> 32:52.679
Anything noteworthy?

32:52.762 --> 32:55.348
-Well, my hand is…
-I was about to report to you.

32:56.057 --> 32:58.101
I think Ms. Jung is really scared.

32:58.184 --> 33:01.145
She was worried and asked
if it was okay to continue this.

33:01.229 --> 33:03.439
I'll meet with Ms. Jung.

33:03.523 --> 33:07.819
You check every student's social media
at the school.

33:07.902 --> 33:09.737
Find any slander about the teachers.

33:11.614 --> 33:12.490
You mean me, sir?

33:12.573 --> 33:14.200
-Why? Don't you want to?
-Yes, I do.

33:14.283 --> 33:15.785
All right. Good luck with it.

33:15.868 --> 33:17.036
But my hand…

33:22.709 --> 33:23.584
Good luck.

33:26.796 --> 33:28.089
Deputy Bong.

33:30.383 --> 33:31.426
Deputy Director Bong.

33:34.929 --> 33:35.763
Yes?

33:38.141 --> 33:42.603
I believe work is only done efficiently
with a command structure.

33:42.687 --> 33:44.856
You can just stay there and talk.

33:46.816 --> 33:49.027
I'm saying
there should be a chain of command.

33:50.069 --> 33:50.903
Right.

33:50.987 --> 33:52.697
Right. What grade?

33:53.281 --> 33:54.115
Pardon?

33:54.198 --> 33:55.533
What grade are you?

33:55.616 --> 33:57.952
I'm Grade Five…

33:59.871 --> 34:00.705
I'm Grade One.

34:01.539 --> 34:03.124
I'm a higher grade, and I'm older,

34:03.207 --> 34:06.335
so I hope you'll follow
my instructions carefully.

34:06.419 --> 34:09.088
I ask that you monitor
all the students' social media.

34:09.172 --> 34:10.506
Every single student.

34:11.174 --> 34:12.550
Right now?

34:16.220 --> 34:17.722
By the end of the day.

34:20.058 --> 34:21.642
Grade Five? What's wrong with you?

34:23.811 --> 34:24.812
You haven't served.

34:26.939 --> 34:28.566
Let me know when you're done!

34:57.178 --> 35:00.014
I'm sorry.
I'd like the class for a moment.

35:07.605 --> 35:08.940
Do you recognize these?

35:09.857 --> 35:12.276
They're photos you posted on social media

35:12.360 --> 35:15.238
that were taken illegally and then edited

35:15.738 --> 35:17.323
to mock your teachers.

35:17.824 --> 35:21.577
These prove you spread false information
with malicious intent.

35:22.078 --> 35:25.665
This is a criminal act
that constitutes defamation.

35:26.415 --> 35:28.167
From now on,

35:28.251 --> 35:32.046
the ERPB will crack down
on online violations of teachers' rights.

35:33.631 --> 35:34.632
By the way,

35:34.715 --> 35:37.969
isn't going through our social media
a violation of human rights?

35:38.052 --> 35:40.054
Yeah, this is a human rights violation.

35:40.138 --> 35:43.391
I'm asking whether the ERPB has
that kind of authority.

35:47.103 --> 35:51.607
If you want to know about our authority,
I suggest you visit the ERPB website,

35:52.108 --> 35:55.236
go to "Bureau Introduction,"
and then "Grounds of Establishment."

35:55.319 --> 35:57.238
There, under "Legal Documents,"

35:57.321 --> 36:01.200
you will see the ERPB Establishment Act,
where you can read Article 8.

36:02.910 --> 36:04.078
All right, then.

36:04.162 --> 36:09.333
Those whose names are called,
report to the field!

36:09.417 --> 36:11.627
Stay in formation.

36:11.711 --> 36:12.795
Stay in formation.

36:12.879 --> 36:15.173
Left flank, march forward!

36:15.256 --> 36:17.300
Left flank!

36:17.383 --> 36:19.385
This is so annoying, seriously!

36:19.468 --> 36:20.678
My legs hurt so damn much.

36:21.179 --> 36:23.306
Hey, who the hell called in the ERPB?

36:23.389 --> 36:24.849
Isn't it obvious?

36:25.349 --> 36:28.144
It's the teachers calling in the ERPB
to back them up.

36:28.728 --> 36:30.396
I don't think so.

36:32.899 --> 36:33.774
What?

36:33.858 --> 36:36.652
Why else would they have come?
There's no reason.

36:36.736 --> 36:39.030
It could be because of Mr. Ko.

36:40.114 --> 36:42.700
Honestly, we all know
he wouldn't do something like that.

36:42.783 --> 36:45.036
And it's not like anyone saw it happen.

36:49.332 --> 36:52.501
Did you guys see it?
Did you see Mr. Ko with Ye-ri?

36:52.585 --> 36:54.337
What are you all talking about?

36:56.047 --> 36:57.173
Is it about me?

37:00.343 --> 37:03.930
We were talking about the ERPB,
wondering when they'd get lost.

37:05.973 --> 37:07.266
It must be hard on you.

37:07.350 --> 37:10.353
They'll be leaving soon enough.
Don't worry about it.

37:10.853 --> 37:11.687
Let's go.

37:12.772 --> 37:14.232
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

37:21.489 --> 37:23.407
HAN YE-RI: GUESS WHO LIVES HERE?

37:23.491 --> 37:25.826
ISN'T THAT YE-RI'S HOMEROOM TEACHER
BACK THERE?

37:27.370 --> 37:30.790
THIS IS SURYEON VILLA NEAR MY PLACE!

37:46.514 --> 37:48.307
MISANG HAGWON

37:48.391 --> 37:49.725
RÉSUMÉ

37:51.894 --> 37:53.771
Are you really thinking of quitting?

37:53.854 --> 37:56.315
There's so much to think about
in a school.

37:56.399 --> 38:00.069
You're dealing with everything
from student support to paperwork.

38:00.569 --> 38:03.155
But in a hagwon,

38:03.698 --> 38:06.450
I feel like you can just focus
on the lessons.

38:06.534 --> 38:08.077
I'm a little surprised.

38:08.160 --> 38:10.329
Our friends made a bet

38:10.413 --> 38:12.748
on which of us would become principal.

38:12.832 --> 38:15.584
You were the clear winner, Seon-yeong.

38:16.335 --> 38:17.878
Yeah, I know.

38:20.464 --> 38:24.552
Well, I thought I'd try enjoying life.

38:30.558 --> 38:34.395
There are many Soyeon Girls' High students
who come to our hagwon.

38:34.478 --> 38:36.522
I did hear about you too.

38:37.023 --> 38:40.776
Hagwons and schools are all the same.
It's not easy here either.

38:40.860 --> 38:43.070
And you've always been tough.

38:43.571 --> 38:45.740
If you really can't take it anymore,
come back.

38:46.240 --> 38:47.616
Let's talk again then.

38:50.411 --> 38:52.079
Okay.

39:02.840 --> 39:04.091
Hello.

39:15.436 --> 39:17.188
-Ms. Jung.
-Yes?

39:17.271 --> 39:20.274
I've been solving problems,
but I'm stuck on one.

39:20.858 --> 39:21.776
Let's see.

39:22.276 --> 39:23.694
It's question 18.

39:23.778 --> 39:25.946
I just don't get
why the answer is number three.

39:26.530 --> 39:28.074
Oh, this one?

39:28.783 --> 39:32.787
You need to know the definition
of "combination" to solve this.

39:33.287 --> 39:35.498
Here, 50 choose k equals

39:35.581 --> 39:40.836
50 factorial over k factorial multiplied
by 50 minus k factorial…

39:45.132 --> 39:46.592
So the answer is number three.

39:48.094 --> 39:49.595
This was so confusing.

39:50.388 --> 39:53.182
But you've made it easier to understand.

39:53.265 --> 39:55.351
I should've come to see you earlier.

39:55.434 --> 39:57.311
-Thank you, Ms. Jung.
-Sure.

39:58.771 --> 40:02.316
If I get stuck solving problems again,

40:02.817 --> 40:04.402
could I ask you again?

40:06.112 --> 40:07.029
Yes, of course.

40:08.239 --> 40:09.490
Thank you.

40:12.952 --> 40:13.869
Hello.

40:20.042 --> 40:22.503
So what we learned in the last class is…

40:22.586 --> 40:24.088
Conditional probability.

40:28.092 --> 40:28.926
Yes.

40:29.468 --> 40:33.097
We'll use conditional probability
to solve this problem.

40:33.180 --> 40:37.017
If we choose only natural numbers that are
multiples of two, from one to twelve,

40:37.101 --> 40:38.686
then P(A) would be…

40:38.769 --> 40:40.729
Six over twelve.

40:43.357 --> 40:44.358
Right.

40:45.025 --> 40:47.111
That's right. It's six over twelve.

40:47.862 --> 40:49.613
And P(B) is…

40:49.697 --> 40:51.824
Four over twelve.

40:52.408 --> 40:55.035
The probability of A and B is…

40:55.119 --> 40:56.245
Two over twelve.

40:56.829 --> 40:59.039
Shall we try to solve question two
the same way?

40:59.123 --> 41:01.000
Yes, ma'am.

41:01.083 --> 41:02.835
-Who wants to try?
-Kang Min-seo does.

41:02.918 --> 41:04.503
Jin Sang-hui does.

41:05.713 --> 41:06.547
-Min-seo?
-Yes.

41:06.630 --> 41:07.923
-Do you want to try?
-Try it.

41:08.007 --> 41:10.050
Okay. Come up and have a go, Min-seo.

41:15.097 --> 41:16.098
Ms. Jung!

41:17.183 --> 41:19.602
Today's lesson was the best!
I really enjoyed it.

41:19.685 --> 41:21.020
You were epic today.

41:23.189 --> 41:24.106
You're the best!

41:25.232 --> 41:26.192
Ms. Jung.

41:31.655 --> 41:33.574
You must not be so easily swayed.

41:33.657 --> 41:36.702
She's cunning
and may just be gaslighting you.

41:37.620 --> 41:39.246
It'd be best to keep your guard up.

41:41.665 --> 41:42.917
I'm aware of it too.

41:45.127 --> 41:48.172
Whether this is real or just an act,

41:48.881 --> 41:51.258
they're still changing.

41:53.427 --> 41:55.346
I'm so grateful to the ERPB

41:55.930 --> 41:58.015
for even getting us this far.

41:59.391 --> 42:00.518
Thank you.

42:16.659 --> 42:17.576
Ms. Jung.

42:19.245 --> 42:21.580
Ye-ri, what brings you here?

42:21.664 --> 42:23.916
You're probably wondering
why I'm being so nice.

42:25.125 --> 42:29.129
I've wanted to get to know you better
for a while now.

42:29.213 --> 42:31.840
But I felt like
you had the wrong idea about me.

42:32.424 --> 42:34.885
And I didn't know where to start
to clear it up.

42:35.886 --> 42:37.221
So it took me a while.

42:38.430 --> 42:39.348
I'm sorry.

42:41.308 --> 42:42.893
On that note,

42:42.977 --> 42:45.521
how does live streaming sound?

42:46.730 --> 42:47.773
Live streaming?

42:47.856 --> 42:51.402
I want to let people know
that we're on good terms again,

42:51.485 --> 42:55.239
and wouldn't it clear up
some of the misunderstandings about you?

42:59.618 --> 43:01.620
STUDY PLAN

43:06.000 --> 43:07.876
YEAR 3, CLASS 4, HAN YE-RI

43:09.461 --> 43:10.546
And in return,

43:10.629 --> 43:14.049
it would be good
if you could speak a bit about the ERPB.

43:14.842 --> 43:15.676
Sorry?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.721
Everyone is having a real hard time
because of it.

43:18.804 --> 43:21.015
They keep asking me for help.

43:22.349 --> 43:25.185
Don't you think they'd love it
if you helped too?

43:36.822 --> 43:37.823
Ms. Jung.

43:39.617 --> 43:42.244
Have you ever cut class before?

43:43.412 --> 43:44.246
Pardon?

43:44.788 --> 43:46.457
Cut class?

43:55.424 --> 43:57.676
My goodness, they're so precious.

43:57.760 --> 43:58.677
Aren't they?

43:59.261 --> 44:01.680
Makes you wonder
where those monstrous kids come from.

44:03.515 --> 44:06.435
What is it that you wanted to say?

44:07.936 --> 44:10.397
How much longer
are you going to put up with this?

44:11.273 --> 44:12.691
Isn't it about time this ended?

44:18.947 --> 44:20.032
ALL THE DOGS FORUM

44:21.867 --> 44:23.243
SCHOOLS THESE DAYS… OMG

44:23.327 --> 44:24.662
Take a look at this.

44:26.038 --> 44:28.082
It's a picture of me that Ye-ri posted.

44:28.582 --> 44:31.251
Time and time again,
I report it, and it gets removed,

44:31.335 --> 44:33.420
but it shows up again somewhere else.

44:33.921 --> 44:37.966
In the end, I'll just get branded
as that kind of person.

44:38.050 --> 44:40.260
I have to live the rest of my life

44:41.220 --> 44:47.017
proving I'm really not that kind of person
and that things weren't as they seemed.

44:47.518 --> 44:50.396
And when I get tired of it,

44:52.064 --> 44:53.232
I'll probably end up

44:54.149 --> 44:55.901
like Mr. Ko.

45:02.908 --> 45:04.993
I'm afraid of the students.

45:05.911 --> 45:09.206
Just seeing Ye-ri's hand on her phone
makes my heart pound.

45:14.002 --> 45:17.548
My fiancée was a teacher.

45:19.550 --> 45:20.968
Two years ago…

45:24.722 --> 45:28.434
she lost her life
at the hands of a student she taught.

45:31.687 --> 45:33.480
We'll start your photo session.

45:33.564 --> 45:35.691
Okay. Bride, you're looking great.

45:36.191 --> 45:37.359
Okay.

45:37.443 --> 45:39.862
Groom, you should look at the bride too.

45:39.945 --> 45:41.822
-Right.
-That's great.

45:41.905 --> 45:43.866
Groom, hold your arm higher.

46:54.686 --> 46:55.604
Ga-yun.

46:59.316 --> 47:00.859
Ga-yun, I'm here.

47:32.641 --> 47:34.351
Thank you for waiting for me.

48:10.762 --> 48:13.974
So I truly understand
the fear you're feeling

48:14.057 --> 48:17.519
after what happened to Mr. Ko.

48:19.313 --> 48:21.440
But that's why I am asking this of you.

48:21.940 --> 48:23.901
It's not for your sake.

48:25.569 --> 48:28.739
It's for the sake of the kids you teach.

48:36.705 --> 48:37.915
Ms. Jung.

48:38.457 --> 48:40.500
Why do you think we came here?

48:42.836 --> 48:43.837
Of course,

48:44.379 --> 48:46.840
because of Mr. Ko…

48:46.924 --> 48:48.842
No, we are here because of you.

48:53.472 --> 48:57.309
The kids requested that we save you.

48:59.019 --> 49:00.437
Year 3, class 4.

49:01.521 --> 49:04.232
They're students in your homeroom class.

49:05.901 --> 49:07.861
REPORTS RELATED TO SOYEON GIRLS' HIGH

49:07.945 --> 49:13.116
Hello. I am Park Su-jin,
a student at Soyeon Girls' High School.

49:13.200 --> 49:14.576
When I saw strange rumors

49:14.660 --> 49:18.538
and slanderous posts spreading
about our homeroom teacher,

49:18.622 --> 49:22.459
I was so upset and angry
that I decided to write this letter.

49:22.542 --> 49:26.338
After a post was shared
claiming Ms. Jung wasn't teaching,

49:26.421 --> 49:28.757
the whole school fell into chaos.

49:28.840 --> 49:30.759
But the claim just isn't true.

49:30.842 --> 49:35.013
We want to see her teach
with full passion again, like before.

49:35.097 --> 49:38.266
Please protect
Ms. Jung's honor and rights.

49:38.767 --> 49:43.438
Please take this situation seriously
and protect teachers like Ms. Jung,

49:43.522 --> 49:46.483
who quietly devote themselves
to supporting their students

49:47.192 --> 49:49.736
and ensuring they are no longer harmed.

49:50.237 --> 49:52.364
I ask you with utmost sincerity.

49:58.620 --> 50:00.038
Stop it.

50:02.624 --> 50:05.877
I WISH I COULD LISTEN TO HER CLASS

50:11.049 --> 50:15.762
I don't think playing the same game
meant they felt the same way.

50:16.263 --> 50:17.264
I FEEL BAD FOR OUR TEACHER

50:17.347 --> 50:20.809
There are some kids
who are as afraid of Ye-ri as you are.

50:21.309 --> 50:23.687
They had been keeping quiet,

50:24.187 --> 50:25.814
asking themselves,

50:26.440 --> 50:29.818
"If the teacher can't do anything,
what on earth can I do?"

50:30.318 --> 50:33.113
TO US, SHE IS A GOOD TEACHER

50:33.196 --> 50:34.031
PLEASE HELP US

50:34.114 --> 50:35.824
WE WANT TO SEE HER TEACH WITH A SMILE

50:37.284 --> 50:39.327
Don't you think they are the real victims?

50:49.963 --> 50:52.883
And the only person
who can save those kids

50:54.259 --> 50:55.427
is you.

51:00.098 --> 51:05.228
Our efforts to change the school
will only be a temporary measure.

51:05.729 --> 51:07.397
It's the teachers on duty

51:08.315 --> 51:09.566
who ultimately must act.

51:12.319 --> 51:13.445
So we will make sure

51:13.945 --> 51:17.449
no teacher is ever harmed at school.

51:19.326 --> 51:21.495
The ERPB will protect you.

51:28.126 --> 51:29.711
So please don't…

51:33.256 --> 51:35.675
give up on being a teacher.

51:39.513 --> 51:40.931
Please.

51:48.271 --> 51:49.272
Check this out.

51:50.273 --> 51:52.901
Hey, Ms. Jung is here. Take it down.

52:01.743 --> 52:02.786
Ms. Jung.

52:03.578 --> 52:05.455
Have you thought about the live stream?

52:06.081 --> 52:08.834
Everyone in our class has agreed
to be on it.

52:08.917 --> 52:11.920
I posted about it on Snstar,
and the response is insane.

52:12.003 --> 52:13.839
Many influencers also offered to help.

52:14.464 --> 52:15.799
Ms. Jung.

52:16.800 --> 52:17.801
You'll do it, right?

52:20.345 --> 52:21.179
Sorry.

52:22.222 --> 52:23.473
I don't think I can.

52:31.481 --> 52:34.109
All right, then. Let's start the class.

52:34.734 --> 52:36.319
What page were we on?

52:36.403 --> 52:38.864
Page 38.

52:39.531 --> 52:40.407
Okay.

52:42.325 --> 52:44.870
Pages 38 and 39.

53:01.094 --> 53:02.220
Han Ye-ri.

53:08.560 --> 53:09.728
Come up and solve this.

53:16.067 --> 53:18.653
Han Ye-ri, can't you hear me?

53:26.578 --> 53:27.996
I'm talking to you right now.

53:30.165 --> 53:31.166
Solve the problem.

53:37.797 --> 53:39.090
Why are you doing this?

53:39.174 --> 53:40.717
No, that's not what you say.

53:40.800 --> 53:43.220
You should answer, "Yes, ma'am."

53:43.303 --> 53:44.596
I don't want to.

53:45.472 --> 53:47.432
-Come up.
-I said I don't want to.

53:47.515 --> 53:48.683
Solve the problem.

53:49.267 --> 53:50.352
Han Ye-ri.

53:50.435 --> 53:51.269
Ms. Im.

53:51.770 --> 53:53.688
This is my class time.

54:02.572 --> 54:03.949
Come on up.

54:05.742 --> 54:06.701
Damn it.

54:09.579 --> 54:10.997
Seriously.

54:12.832 --> 54:13.667
Solve it.

54:14.334 --> 54:15.210
I won't.

54:15.794 --> 54:16.878
Hold out your palms.

54:20.173 --> 54:21.132
What are you doing?

54:22.259 --> 54:24.552
You know this is child abuse, don't you?

54:37.357 --> 54:38.191
Solve it.

54:39.901 --> 54:41.152
I said I don't want to.

54:41.236 --> 54:42.988
If you don't, I won't end the class.

54:43.071 --> 54:44.781
I don't want to!

54:44.864 --> 54:45.865
Damn it.

54:46.992 --> 54:48.326
Palms out.

54:50.829 --> 54:52.747
Hand out. Straight.

54:52.831 --> 54:54.332
Or you'll get hurt.

55:17.230 --> 55:18.356
I'm sorry.

55:19.190 --> 55:20.775
I shouldn't have done this

55:21.943 --> 55:23.653
to you.

55:26.364 --> 55:27.782
From now on,

55:28.533 --> 55:29.951
I'll be making things right.

55:31.828 --> 55:33.496
I'll make you answer me,

55:35.165 --> 55:37.083
look at the board,

55:38.418 --> 55:40.003
and focus on the class.

55:42.005 --> 55:43.590
If you do something wrong…

55:45.175 --> 55:46.551
If you do something wrong,

55:47.135 --> 55:48.511
I'll scold you every time.

55:49.346 --> 55:51.348
If that fails, I'll hit you like before.

55:58.063 --> 56:00.690
This isn't for me, guys.

56:01.983 --> 56:03.443
This is for you.

56:05.362 --> 56:07.072
Teachers have

56:08.531 --> 56:12.911
a duty to steer their students
in the right direction.

56:16.915 --> 56:18.166
Don't move.

56:19.626 --> 56:21.252
Class isn't over yet.

56:21.961 --> 56:22.837
Sit down.

56:32.180 --> 56:33.139
Solve it.

56:39.521 --> 56:41.689
If you don't, no one can leave.

57:39.330 --> 57:40.832
Jung Seon-yeong!

57:40.915 --> 57:43.001
Nice work!

57:47.547 --> 57:50.216
Ms. Jung! You're amazing!

57:52.093 --> 57:54.345
Fuck, just see if I put up with this.

57:54.429 --> 57:57.307
This is the identity
of the secondary perpetrator.

57:57.390 --> 58:01.102
Soyeon Girls' High School math teacher.
Fucking hell.

58:01.186 --> 58:02.687
I'm going to kill you.

58:07.650 --> 58:10.028
Just wait and see.
I'll destroy everything.

58:10.111 --> 58:12.322
I'm going to post it everywhere.
Fucking bitch.

58:15.158 --> 58:16.201
SHARING

58:16.284 --> 58:17.285
UNABLE TO UPLOAD PHOTO

58:17.368 --> 58:19.996
Why is this screwing me over too?
Fucking hell.

58:20.705 --> 58:21.539
Come on.

58:25.251 --> 58:27.003
What the hell? Is this thing crazy?

58:28.838 --> 58:30.924
Hey, who said to delete this? Hey!

58:36.137 --> 58:37.388
DELETE THIS POST?
DELETE

58:38.932 --> 58:40.183
No way.

58:40.266 --> 58:41.935
This can't be. No, don't.

58:42.018 --> 58:43.019
THERE ARE NO POSTS

58:43.102 --> 58:44.354
No, wait.

58:44.437 --> 58:45.980
No! This can't be real!

58:46.064 --> 58:47.065
Wait!

58:47.815 --> 58:48.691
Just wait.

58:48.775 --> 58:50.652
Damn it!

58:50.735 --> 58:51.736
Shit.

58:51.819 --> 58:53.196
Hey. Damn it.

58:53.279 --> 58:56.658
My homeroom teacher sexually harassed me.

58:57.242 --> 58:59.077
What do I do?

59:00.745 --> 59:01.579
WHAT'S THIS?

59:01.663 --> 59:02.997
YE-RI, WHY ARE YOU REPOSTING?

59:03.081 --> 59:04.207
MAKES ME ANGRY AGAIN

59:04.290 --> 59:05.333
This can't be. Wait.

59:05.416 --> 59:08.253
-What will you do, Ko Yeong-su?
-Why is this…

59:08.336 --> 59:11.130
-You're definitely finished.
-No.

59:11.214 --> 59:12.215
-Definitely.
-No.

59:12.298 --> 59:13.132
No, wait.

59:15.134 --> 59:16.594
No, wait.

59:16.678 --> 59:17.720
HOW CREEPY

59:17.804 --> 59:20.848
Hey, stop it! Damn it!

59:20.932 --> 59:21.975
HAS SHE LOST IT?

59:22.058 --> 59:23.560
HAN YE-RI'S DOWNFALL CONFIRMED

59:23.643 --> 59:24.644
DOWNFALL? JAIL CONFIRMED

59:24.727 --> 59:25.562
So pretty.

59:25.645 --> 59:26.479
ZERO RESPONSIBILITY

59:26.563 --> 59:28.898
How can you be so pretty,
even when you're crying?

59:28.982 --> 59:30.066
Han Ye-ri.

59:31.359 --> 59:32.443
Seriously.

59:34.779 --> 59:36.114
Please stop!

59:36.197 --> 59:39.117
THIS ACCOUNT HAS BEEN SUSPENDED
AT THE GOVERNMENT'S REQUEST

59:41.744 --> 59:43.371
Great work, Deputy Bong.

59:43.454 --> 59:46.165
Then may I go home now?

59:46.249 --> 59:48.876
No. There's a welcome dinner for me.

59:49.377 --> 59:50.587
Yeah, she says no.

59:51.713 --> 59:53.006
Great work.

59:54.507 --> 59:55.508
Minister.

01:00:01.097 --> 01:00:02.390
EXPOSING A MURDERER!

01:00:02.473 --> 01:00:03.891
REVEALING HAN YE-RI'S HOUSE

01:00:06.853 --> 01:00:08.438
THE TEEN BEHIND TEACHER'S DEATH

01:00:11.274 --> 01:00:13.026
I can't get a hold of Ye-ri.

01:00:13.693 --> 01:00:16.821
Please check on her. I'm worried.

01:00:20.241 --> 01:00:21.242
HAN YE-RI

01:00:24.162 --> 01:00:25.496
Yes, who is it?

01:00:27.957 --> 01:00:29.292
Hey, Ye-ri.

01:00:29.375 --> 01:00:32.462
Why aren't you answering your phone?

01:00:32.545 --> 01:00:33.755
Ye-ri, are you okay?

01:00:34.255 --> 01:00:36.633
Come inside for a moment.

01:00:38.051 --> 01:00:39.677
Have you eaten?

01:00:40.178 --> 01:00:41.137
Ye-ri.

01:00:45.933 --> 01:00:48.770
It should've been you, not Ko Yeong-su.

01:00:49.604 --> 01:00:50.438
Sorry?

01:00:50.521 --> 01:00:53.316
Ko Yeong-su died because of you.

01:00:55.777 --> 01:00:59.489
No one listens to what I say anymore.
They don't believe me.

01:01:00.365 --> 01:01:04.035
Do you know
why I fought like hell to get here?

01:01:07.747 --> 01:01:10.166
Have you ever thought about why I did it?

01:01:10.249 --> 01:01:11.542
Have you?

01:01:13.044 --> 01:01:16.339
All teachers are hypocrites.

01:01:17.757 --> 01:01:18.591
Ye-ri.

01:01:24.180 --> 01:01:25.098
Fuck.

01:01:26.557 --> 01:01:27.392
Fine.

01:01:27.975 --> 01:01:29.936
I'll give everyone the ending they want

01:01:30.645 --> 01:01:31.479
and go die.

01:01:33.189 --> 01:01:34.565
But…

01:01:37.860 --> 01:01:38.736
you die too.

01:01:40.530 --> 01:01:41.489
Damn it!

01:01:44.909 --> 01:01:46.911
Ye-ri, that's dangerous. Hold on.

01:01:46.994 --> 01:01:48.746
Put that down. Okay, Ye-ri?

01:01:48.830 --> 01:01:49.872
Ye-ri!

01:01:50.456 --> 01:01:52.250
Ye-ri, don't!

01:01:55.670 --> 01:01:56.921
Ye-ri!

01:02:00.675 --> 01:02:01.676
Don't do it.

01:02:17.150 --> 01:02:18.776
-What was that?
-It's a person!

01:02:18.860 --> 01:02:20.361
Someone just fell!

01:02:21.779 --> 01:02:23.156
Oh my God.

01:02:23.239 --> 01:02:24.532
Honey!

01:02:26.951 --> 01:02:29.245
Mom! Dad! Come here, quick!

01:02:29.954 --> 01:02:30.955
Inspector Na.

01:02:41.424 --> 01:02:43.551
The person who fell out of that window

01:02:44.635 --> 01:02:47.764
said to write "patience" three times
if I ever want to kill someone.

01:02:48.473 --> 01:02:50.349
So put that knife down.

01:02:53.478 --> 01:02:54.562
What…

01:02:56.731 --> 01:02:58.107
I've written it twice.

01:03:01.110 --> 01:03:02.236
Damn it!

01:03:05.448 --> 01:03:06.949
At this rate, you will die.

01:03:07.033 --> 01:03:08.242
Wait a moment.

01:03:11.370 --> 01:03:12.205
Damn it!

01:03:15.333 --> 01:03:16.667
Your hand!

01:03:58.793 --> 01:03:59.794
Han Ye-ri.

01:04:01.671 --> 01:04:03.297
Don't worry. I won't kill you.

01:04:04.507 --> 01:04:07.301
Think hard about all the things
you've done.

01:04:08.594 --> 01:04:10.179
Were you afraid you might die?

01:04:11.430 --> 01:04:12.265
Live.

01:04:13.432 --> 01:04:15.017
Live and repent.

01:04:32.285 --> 01:04:33.452
Oh my God.

01:04:36.247 --> 01:04:38.958
Oh my God. Put this down.

01:04:40.001 --> 01:04:41.377
Oh my God.

01:04:42.503 --> 01:04:44.922
Inspector Na.

01:04:45.006 --> 01:04:45.840
Inspector Na!

01:04:45.923 --> 01:04:47.884
-Are you okay? Oh my God.
-Inspector!

01:04:47.967 --> 01:04:49.427
Call… What is it again?

01:04:49.510 --> 01:04:51.095
Call 119. Where's my phone?

01:04:51.178 --> 01:04:52.555
Call 119. What?

01:04:53.681 --> 01:04:55.182
It's time to get up now.

01:04:55.266 --> 01:04:58.019
That height wouldn't even count
as a hill in field training.

01:05:01.022 --> 01:05:02.273
That's why it didn't hurt.

01:05:04.275 --> 01:05:05.109
Are you okay?

01:05:05.192 --> 01:05:06.611
Yes, I'm fine. Yes.

01:05:07.778 --> 01:05:11.032
Are you crazy?
Do you have extra lives or something?

01:05:13.159 --> 01:05:15.119
I told you I'd protect you.

01:05:21.876 --> 01:05:24.587
Ms. Im, there's blood. He's bleeding.

01:05:25.212 --> 01:05:27.006
-There's blood.
-What's wrong with him?

01:05:27.089 --> 01:05:28.215
I think he's shocked.

01:05:29.175 --> 01:05:30.885
-He's bleeding heavily.
-Deputy Bong!

01:05:30.968 --> 01:05:32.261
-Oh my God.
-I'm okay.

01:05:32.345 --> 01:05:33.846
-My sweat is red.
-Deputy Bong?

01:05:34.805 --> 01:05:37.308
Should we call 119? Deputy Bong?

01:05:37.391 --> 01:05:39.268
Han-rim, I'm still bleeding here.

01:05:39.352 --> 01:05:41.145
-Ms. Jung, do you have a stapler?
-Bong.

01:05:41.228 --> 01:05:43.022
-Deputy Bong.
-Why do you ask?

01:05:43.105 --> 01:05:44.148
Deputy Bong.

01:05:44.231 --> 01:05:46.442
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

01:05:49.820 --> 01:05:53.240
Recently, the nature
of educational rights violations

01:05:53.324 --> 01:05:55.242
has been intensifying.

01:05:55.326 --> 01:05:57.578
In the recent case
at Soyeon Girls' High School,

01:05:58.079 --> 01:06:00.748
there was even a cyber violation
of educational rights

01:06:00.831 --> 01:06:02.833
where a teacher's reputation was damaged

01:06:02.917 --> 01:06:05.294
by leaked personal information
and false statements.

01:06:05.878 --> 01:06:07.630
In response, the ERPB

01:06:07.713 --> 01:06:10.883
will permanently suspend any accounts
that harm a teacher's reputation

01:06:10.967 --> 01:06:13.678
through cyber violations
of educational rights.

01:06:14.178 --> 01:06:18.265
And we will thoroughly investigate
and severely punish those responsible.

01:06:20.685 --> 01:06:21.852
Does this make any sense?

01:06:22.645 --> 01:06:26.315
An assemblyman's daughter was a victim,
yet the case received no coverage at all.

01:06:26.399 --> 01:06:29.777
They said the bereaved family
wanted to keep it quiet.

01:06:29.860 --> 01:06:30.820
Were you listening?

01:06:33.864 --> 01:06:35.574
What do you think his play was?

01:06:36.951 --> 01:06:38.786
If it gained traction back then,

01:06:39.495 --> 01:06:42.999
he probably thought his daughter's death
would be used for political purposes.

01:06:43.541 --> 01:06:45.751
Then the ERPB wouldn't have happened.

01:06:45.835 --> 01:06:48.254
The ERPB was
all Choi Gang-seok thought about

01:06:48.337 --> 01:06:50.131
from the moment his daughter died.

01:06:50.214 --> 01:06:52.216
Has he always been that meticulous?

01:06:53.092 --> 01:06:55.594
I would see it as sheer desperation.

01:06:56.637 --> 01:06:58.764
It seems we have underestimated
Choi Gang-seok.

01:06:59.348 --> 01:07:01.017
What will you do, sir?

01:07:06.897 --> 01:07:08.816
Tell the beat reporters I'd like a word.

01:07:09.316 --> 01:07:11.610
GA-YUN: I'M A DAD'S GIRL
EDUCATIONAL RIGHTS RILE ME

01:07:11.694 --> 01:07:13.654
GANG-SEOK: WANT TO SIT
IN A RELATED MEETING?

01:07:13.738 --> 01:07:16.073
GA-YUN: IS THIS A PRIVILEGE?
GANG-SEOK: IT'S A DUTY

01:07:20.536 --> 01:07:21.454
CUP NOODLES AGAIN?

01:07:21.537 --> 01:07:22.913
IT'S "INSTANT HEALTH FOOD"

01:07:22.997 --> 01:07:24.331
DAD, HAVE A PROPER MEAL

01:07:24.415 --> 01:07:26.292
THEN HAVE A MEAL WITH ME. IT'S ON ME

01:07:26.375 --> 01:07:29.003
SATURDAY, NOV 30, 2024
MY LOVING DAUGHTER, I MISS YOU

01:07:33.299 --> 01:07:35.176
SUNDAY DEC 8, 2024
I'M SORRY, GA-YUN

01:07:35.259 --> 01:07:37.178
TUESDAY, DEC 31, 2024
I WILL DO MY BEST

01:07:55.905 --> 01:07:58.365
Minister, I think you need to see this.

01:07:58.449 --> 01:07:59.825
I'm sending you a link.

01:08:04.747 --> 01:08:07.249
I'm sure you will remember
the death of a female teacher

01:08:07.792 --> 01:08:09.960
that led to the establishment of the ERPB.

01:08:10.044 --> 01:08:13.547
The current Minister of Education
and head of the ERPB, Choi Gang-seok,

01:08:13.631 --> 01:08:15.758
is the victim's father.

01:08:17.176 --> 01:08:19.261
And Inspector Na Hwa-jin was her fiancé.

01:08:29.230 --> 01:08:30.648
Those investigated by the ERPB,

01:08:30.731 --> 01:08:34.276
Ryu Jun-hyeong of Daehan High,
the students at Guun High-Tech High,

01:08:34.360 --> 01:08:37.780
and Soyeon Girls' High School,
are all students.

01:08:39.490 --> 01:08:40.491
Is it truly possible

01:08:41.200 --> 01:08:44.620
this has nothing to do with
the teacher killed by her student?

01:08:45.204 --> 01:08:49.166
These people are not working
for educational rights.

01:08:50.084 --> 01:08:51.460
It is cruel revenge

01:08:52.586 --> 01:08:55.131
for the death
of their daughter and fiancée.

01:08:57.758 --> 01:08:59.510
It is a personal vendetta.

01:10:20.466 --> 01:10:23.427
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
